{"version":1,"key":"card:14","content":{"id":14,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当一个变量它只有有限取值的时候，可以使用枚举，也可以使用联合类型，那应该使用哪个呢，比如对于服务端返回的 code 码"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"type Code = 0 | 1;\n\nenum Code {\n  FAIL = 0;\n  SUCCESS = 1;\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"d64ea46a-bb38-407d-976c-88b59c700293","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从语义的角度考虑，很明显，使用枚举时每个值的语义都很明确，可读性更高，这种场景下推荐使用枚举值。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这种情况因为 code 是服务定义的，或者更抽象的说，可选值不是我们定义的，如果说是我们自己定义的枚举值，那么我们可以将其定义的更加语义化"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"type Status = \"pending\" | \"resolved\" | \"rejected\"\n\nenum Status {\n  Pendding = \"pendding\"\n  Resolved = \"resolved\"\n  Rejected = \"rejected\"\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"47133bc3-1fc7-48c5-be9d-6e725d2e22c2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在这种情况下二者的语义都很明确，我反而倾向于使用联合类型，因为在使用的时候，不用在导入枚举然后去进行判断，直接输入字符串进行判断即可"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"// 联合类型的判断\nif (status === \"resolved\") {\n  \n}\n\n// 枚举的判断\nimport  Status from './types'\nif (status === Status.Resolved) {\n  \n}","language":"Typescript","uuid":"7939d6d7-d5a3-46b0-ac02-fbca061a6ed6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"二者还有一个重大区别会使得开发者更倾向于使用联合类型，那就是 Node.js 对于类型可擦除语法的限制"}]},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"随着 Node.js v23.6.0 发布后，开发者现在可以在 Node.js 中原生使用 TypeScript，无需额外的转译工具（例如： ts-node）或新增手动编译步骤。默认情况下，Node.js 会执行仅包含可擦除 TypeScript 语法 (Erasable TypeScript Syntax) 的 TypeScript 文件。Node.js 会将 TypeScript 语法替换为空格，并且不执行类型检查 。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类型在编译为 JS 时可以被直接擦除，而枚举在编译时会被编译为 JS 对象，无法直接擦除，它不是一个类型，而是一个值。由上可见，如果想在最近的 Node.js 中直接运行 TypeScript，就不能使用枚举语法。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 TypeScript 5.8 或更新版本中，可以在 ts.config.json 中配置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"\"erasableSyntaxOnly\": true","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来限制只使用类型可以擦除的语法。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4oLEdpOIyhxAU16mpsdDTQ#:~:text=Node.js%20%E4%BC%9A%E5%B0%86%20TypeScript%20%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95%E6%9B%BF%E6%8D%A2%E4%B8%BA%E7%A9%BA%E6%A0%BC%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E4%B8%94%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5%C2%A0%E3%80%82%E8%A6%81%E5%90%AF%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E6%93%A6%E9%99%A4%20TypeScript%20%E8%AF%AD%E6%B3%95%E7%9A%84%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%8B%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%9AEnum%E3%80%81namespace%E3%80%81%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7%E3%80%81%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E5%88%AB%E5%90%8D%E3%80%81module%20%E7%AD%89%EF%BC%8C%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%0A%2D%2Dexperimental%2Dtransform%2Dtypes%20%E6%A0%87%E5%BF%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%8C%E8%A6%81%E7%A6%81%E7%94%A8%E6%AD%A4%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%20%2D%2Dno%2Dexperimental%2Dstrip%2Dtypes%20%E6%A0%87%E5%BF%97%E3%80%82","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Node.js 原生支持 TypeScript？开发者需要了解的一切"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/概念辨析","TypeScript/联合类型","TypeScript/枚举"],"createTime":1688912575602,"updateTime":1753693455384,"linkedCards":[{"id":18,"target":{"key":"card:18","type":"card","id":18},"summary":"如果一个值它是有限的几个值，我们一般会将该类型标记为枚举。比如服务返回一个字段 auth ，它只有三种取值： 0 ：只有管理员有权限 1 ：所有人都有权限 2 ：管理员以及部分成员有权限 此时你可以声明一个枚举类型 enum AuthVal...","tags":["TypeScript/数据类型","TypeScript/枚举"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1753693455384}}